00，年結多退少補）</p><p dir=\"auto\">🧹&nbsp;水費＋網路＋垃圾代收＋公共區域清潔｜<strong>NT$800／月</strong></p><h2 dir=\"auto\">✅&nbsp;入住資格</h2><p dir=\"auto\">為維護良好居住品質，承租人需提供：</p><p dir=\"auto\">✔️&nbsp;身分證影本</p><p dir=\"auto\">✔️&nbsp;工作證或名片</p><p dir=\"auto\">📌&nbsp;成交後酌收&nbsp;<strong>半個月租金仲介服務費</strong>（帶看免費）</p><p dir=\"auto\">(99)北縣字第002053號</p><p dir=\"auto\">經紀人：陳畇蓁</p>\r\n附近有便利商店、百貨公司、公園綠地、學校。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "南港區三重路", "lat": "25.0548452", "lng": "121.6130360", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "subway", "name": "南港展覽館站", "distance": 482, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約482公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "南港站", "distance": 63, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約63公尺"}, {"type": "subway", "name": "南港軟體園區站", "distance": 651, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約651公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "shop", "name": "健弘部品 MALOSSI台灣總代理", "distance": 482, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約482公尺"}, {"type": "restaurant", "name": "胖老爹美式炸雞 南一店", "distance": 7, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約7公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "university", "name": "南港社區大學", "distance": 357, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約357公尺"}, {"type": "primary", "name": "臺北市南港區南港國民小學", "distance": 388, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約388公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value": "16,800元/月", "key": "rentPrice"}, {"name": "押金", "value": "二個月", "key": "deposit"}, {"name": "服務費", "value": "半個月租金", "key": "serviceFee"}, {"name": "管理費", "value": "800元/月", "key": "manageprice"}]}, "information": {"title": "基礎資料", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "產權登記", "value": "房屋已辦產權登記", "key": "hasCertificate", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "法定用途", "value": "見使用執照", "key": "purpose", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "可使用面積", "value": "9.08坪", "key": "area", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "屋齡", "value": "-", "key": "age", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "電梯", "value": "無", "key": "lift", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "隔間材料", "value": "水泥磚牆"